\item \code{trait_axis = TRUE}: show the terminal-trait axis.
\item \code{trait_axis_label = "Trait value"}: its label; \code{NULL} suppresses the label.
\item \code{cex.lab}, \code{cex.axis}: text scaling for the terminal-trait axis title and
